<title>UK: UK meals and feeds quiet and unchanged.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feeds quiet and unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds prices were mostly unchanged on Friday in a tradeless market.</p>
<p>Brokers reported little interest following Thursday's trade dinner in London.</p>
<p>&quot;People who work outside London did not get back to their offices until around lunch time and then just got on with some paper work, said one broker.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
